00:14:55.587 --> 00:14:56.838
That's marriage, all right.

00:14:56.922 --> 00:14:59.257
That is so unbelievably manipulative.

00:14:59.383 --> 00:15:01.426
Come on. You never went
on a date with a guy

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:02.719
just 'cause you were hungry?

00:15:02.803 --> 00:15:04.304
Well, I...

00:15:04.388 --> 00:15:07.265
Uh, I thought
I might like him on a full stomach.

00:15:07.349 --> 00:15:09.101
Nice try, sister.

00:15:09.184 --> 00:15:12.896
Now, if you'll excuse me,
I need to meet with my wedding planner.

00:15:12.979 --> 00:15:13.980
Zoidberg!

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:18.694
Zoidy-poo, please tell me
frilly is in this year.

00:15:18.777 --> 00:15:20.779
I saw a frilly cake in here

00:15:20.862 --> 00:15:22.781
you would remember all your life.

00:15:23.115 --> 00:15:24.157
I know I will.

00:15:24.449 --> 00:15:27.828
Late at night it taunts me
with its frosted beauty.

00:15:28.245 --> 00:15:29.705
Order the cake, damn it!

00:15:32.708 --> 00:15:34.376
I have something for you.

00:15:35.168 --> 00:15:36.461
A remote control?

00:15:36.545 --> 00:15:37.879
You got me a TV?

00:15:37.963 --> 00:15:39.047
No, my dearest.

00:15:39.131 --> 00:15:41.466
It's the remote control to my heart.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:45.137
It symbolizes the power
you have to sway my emotions.

00:15:45.303 --> 00:15:46.888
Will it work on my TV?

00:15:46.972 --> 00:15:48.515
We don't need TVs.

00:15:48.598 --> 00:15:49.891
We have each other.

00:15:50.308 --> 00:15:53.603
Coilette, if I weren't able
to spend my life with you,

00:15:53.687 --> 00:15:55.647
I would leap from this very balloon.

00:15:55.731 --> 00:15:56.857
Come on with that.

00:15:56.940 --> 00:15:57.983
Really?

00:15:58.066 --> 00:16:01.778
Yes. We were meant to be!

00:16:03.572 --> 00:16:06.742
So, you really and truly love me?

00:16:06.825 --> 00:16:08.577
So much so that I'm prepared

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:11.580
to give up show business itself
to be with you.

00:16:11.663 --> 00:16:13.332
But you always said

00:16:13.415 --> 00:16:16.543
you'd rather burn down a convent
than give up show business.

00:16:16.626 --> 00:16:18.628
I always said many things

00:16:18.712 --> 00:16:23.383
but now all I want is a peaceful life
in a quiet villa overlooking a vineyard

00:16:23.592 --> 00:16:24.801
with you.

00:16:26.511 --> 00:16:28.055
Would we have donkeys?

00:16:28.138 --> 00:16:29.473
All you could eat.

00:16:29.556 --> 00:16:32.684
Oh, take me in your arms
and compress me!

00:16:32.768 --> 00:16:34.478
Compress me tight!

00:16:34.561 --> 00:16:37.647
Stop. Let us climb to the heavens

00:16:37.731 --> 00:16:40.484
that the gods themselves might envy us.

00:16:47.741 --> 00:16:50.952
I just don't think
I can go through with this scam.

00:16:52.371 --> 00:16:53.955
So now you do want to marry him?

00:16:54.039 --> 00:16:57.626
No. I just don't want
to hurt him or humiliate him.

00:16:57.709 --> 00:17:00.796
Oh, curse this woman's heart!

00:17:03.757 --> 00:17:04.925
Ick.

00:17:05.008 --> 00:17:08.845
You're falling into the final
debilitating stages of womanhood.

00:17:08.929 --> 00:17:11.807
You've waited too long
to switch back, you dingbat.

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:14.309
Okay, look, if I help you with this,

00:17:14.393 --> 00:17:17.187
do you promise to get out
of my gender and stay out?

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.855
Uh-huh.

00:17:18.939 --> 00:17:20.607
All right. Now, there's no way

00:17:20.691 --> 00:17:23.318
to stop this marriage
without hurting Calculon,

00:17:23.402 --> 00:17:24.486
but he's an actor.

00:17:24.569 --> 00:17:26.446
If there's one kind of pain he can handle,

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:27.864
it's soap opera pain.

00:17:41.086 --> 00:17:43.046
Okay, is everyone ready?

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:44.131
- Yep.
- Sure.

00:17:44.214 --> 00:17:45.215
Basically.

00:17:45.298 --> 00:17:48.677
Dearly beloved actors and casting people

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.971
who might be looking for someone
to play a preacher,

00:17:51.054 --> 00:17:53.557
I welcome you.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:55.726
The bride has written some vows

00:17:55.809 --> 00:17:58.770
that we will now all pretend
to be interested in.

00:17:59.396 --> 00:18:00.939
Dearest Calculon,

00:18:01.023 --> 00:18:02.858
forever is not enough time

00:18:02.941 --> 00:18:04.901
to tell you of the many ways I love you.

00:18:08.447 --> 00:18:09.614
Is there a doctor in the...

00:18:09.698 --> 00:18:10.741
I came as soon as I could.

00:18:11.658 --> 00:18:16.163
Oh, it appears to be a case
of African Hydraulic Fever.

00:18:16.246 --> 00:18:21.168
Dear God, the very illness
my TV character caught in Season 2

00:18:21.251 --> 00:18:23.378
when I was holding out for more money.

00:18:23.462 --> 00:18:24.713
It's often fatal.

00:18:24.796 --> 00:18:27.090
Whatever happens, remember,

00:18:27.174 --> 00:18:31.803
the flame of my eternal love
will burn forever.

00:18:32.095 --> 00:18:34.264
Of course. But smoochy-pops,

00:18:34.348 --> 00:18:36.350
I thought one could only catch
Hydraulic Fever

00:18:36.433 --> 00:18:38.685
deep in the diamond mines of the Congo.

00:18:38.769 --> 00:18:40.812
Coilette, you she-devil!

00:18:40.896 --> 00:18:43.440
You really thought
you could steal those diamonds

00:18:43.523 --> 00:18:45.067
from me and Congo Jack?

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:47.778
Those gems belong to the natives!

00:18:47.861 --> 00:18:49.946
Hi-ya!

00:18:50.447 --> 00:18:54.284
Oh, how cruel and melodramatic fate is.

00:18:55.035 --> 00:18:58.246
Why?

00:18:59.122 --> 00:19:00.832
Calculon, my darling,

00:19:00.916 --> 00:19:04.127
your loud "why" brought me
partway back to life.

00:19:08.215 --> 00:19:09.341
Congo Jack!

00:19:09.424 --> 00:19:11.176
Another shocking twist!

00:19:12.928 --> 00:19:15.597
Yes, I and have a message
for you from Colonel Mtumbe.

00:19:15.681 --> 00:19:18.684
He says this is from Congo Jack.

00:19:19.768 --> 00:19:21.144
Uh... Um...

00:19:23.647 --> 00:19:26.692
No. No!

00:19:27.359 --> 00:19:31.154
N-O-O-O!

00:19:31.822 --> 00:19:33.281
I won't leave you.

00:19:33.365 --> 00:19:37.577
Not until I'm sure
you understand the thing I said before

00:19:37.661 --> 00:19:39.746
about my eternal love for you burning...

00:19:42.582 --> 00:19:43.959
...et cetera.

00:19:44.042 --> 00:19:45.168
I do.

00:19:46.503 --> 00:19:47.963
I do.

00:19:48.046 --> 00:19:49.047
Okay, then.

00:19:53.093 --> 00:19:55.637
Mm. I'm a doctor. She's dead.

00:19:56.263 --> 00:19:58.807
She lives no more.

00:19:59.182 --> 00:20:03.395
But let us all find comfort
knowing that she truly loved me.

00:20:04.062 --> 00:20:05.939
To honor my pain,

00:20:06.023 --> 00:20:09.860
I shall star in a film
dedicated to her memory

00:20:09.943 --> 00:20:13.280
and this time the Academy
will not deny me.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:17.868
Not when they see
Coilette: A Calculon Story.

00:20:20.412 --> 00:20:24.333
Coilette, your death fills me with sorrow,

00:20:24.416 --> 00:20:27.169
anger, fear.

00:20:27.252 --> 00:20:29.629
Every emotion an actor can display.

00:20:30.714 --> 00:20:32.299
Turn off that crap-o-rama.

00:20:32.507 --> 00:20:35.010
One mistake now, and Bender
will be trapped forever

00:20:35.093 --> 00:20:38.055
between the already
ill-defined robot sexes.

00:20:38.555 --> 00:20:40.891
Oh! Ooh! Ow! Ooh!

00:20:40.974 --> 00:20:43.060
Well, Bender, I hope
this has taught you a lesson

00:20:43.143 --> 00:20:45.187
about changing your sex
to win five gold medals.

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:46.855
It truly has.

00:20:46.938 --> 00:20:50.692
My romance with Calculon
has shown me a lot about myself.

00:20:50.776 --> 00:20:52.069
Almost done.

00:20:52.152 --> 00:20:56.031
If only somehow, some way, he and I...

00:20:56.114 --> 00:20:57.407
...could drive to Vegas,

00:20:57.491 --> 00:20:59.034
pick up some floozy-bots

00:20:59.117 --> 00:21:03.163
and void their warranties
all night long! Whoo!

00:21:03.246 --> 00:21:05.082
Yay, my buddy's home.

00:21:05.165 --> 00:21:07.209
And his respect for women
is back to normal.

00:21:07.292 --> 00:21:09.378
I kind of hoped
this whole experience

00:21:09.461 --> 00:21:12.172
would have left you a little more open
to your sensitive side.

00:21:12.255 --> 00:21:14.174
Yeah, you'd think, but what ya gonna do?

00:21:18.887 --> 00:21:24.101
Coilette, the skies themselves
weep upon the sweetest flower

00:21:24.184 --> 00:21:25.769
of all the field.

00:21:27.688 --> 00:21:29.064
- Ew!
- Gross!

00:21:29.147 --> 00:21:30.941
Sentimental drivel poop.

00:21:31.024 --> 00:21:32.275
Come on, Bender, let's go.

00:21:32.359 --> 00:21:34.194
This chick flick is getting me all barfy.

00:21:34.277 --> 00:21:37.781
Yeah, emotions are dumb
and should be hated.

00:21:40.701 --> 00:21:43.078
Good night, forever, my turtle dove.

00:21:43.412 --> 00:21:45.330
Good night, Calculon.

00:21:45.414 --> 00:21:46.415
What did you say?

00:21:46.498 --> 00:21:49.251
I said you two don't dress trampy enough.

00:21:49.334 --> 00:21:50.752
I still got it.